 "_design": "Overlord DAir light landing lag (4 frames at 60 fps). Stomp lands with reduced lag: arms stay crossed on chest (Bison crossed arms from dair hold), weight drives down into a small cushion squat on both feet shoulder-width, knees over toes, head counter-pitches level. f0 contact (pelvis -6), f1 small dip (pelvis -14, spine -6, head counter +3), f2 bottom (-16, 1 cm overshoot), f3 back to pelvis -8 with spine -2 (ready to blend to idle). Ease out of contact, ease in at f3, never a snap.",
